{%- comment -%}
Game Time. Payload contract: docs/specs/game-time-screen.md. Vocabulary: CONTEXT.md.
Games are grouped into Today and Tomorrow against the render time (preview_now in fixtures), so the
screen changes sections and leaves the playlist on the clock without a new push. Games arrive sorted by start.
Every size is calc(var(--z) * Npx): --k scales rows by game count, --u by device.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign now_s = preview_now | default: "now" | date: "%s" | plus: 0 -%}
{%- assign upd_s = updated_at | date: "%s" | plus: 0 -%}
{%- comment -%} Local time is the offset updated_at carries ("-04:00"), else the LaraPaper user's. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign off = trmnl.user.utc_offset | default: 0 | plus: 0 -%}
{%- assign tz = updated_at | slice: -6, 6 -%}
{%- assign tz_sign = tz | slice: 0 -%}
{%- if tz_sign == "-" or tz_sign == "+" -%}
  {%- assign tz_h = tz | slice: 1, 2 | plus: 0 -%}{%- assign tz_m = tz | slice: 4, 2 | plus: 0 -%}
  {%- assign off = tz_h | times: 3600 -%}{%- assign tz_m = tz_m | times: 60 -%}{%- assign off = off | plus: tz_m -%}
  {%- if tz_sign == "-" -%}{%- assign off = off | times: -1 -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- assign local_s = now_s | plus: off -%}
{%- assign today = local_s | date: "%Y-%m-%d" -%}
{%- assign yesterday = local_s | minus: 86400 | date: "%Y-%m-%d" -%}
{%- assign tomorrow = local_s | plus: 86400 | date: "%Y-%m-%d" -%}
{%- comment -%} A live game's status text is trusted for 20 minutes after the push; then it reads plain "LIVE". {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign age = now_s | minus: upd_s -%}
{%- comment -%}
Today: games starting today, plus any still live that started yesterday. Tomorrow: games starting tomorrow.
Each list is game indexes ("0,3,"); LaraPaper keeps the empty item after the last comma, so loops skip it.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign t_ids = "" -%}{%- assign m_ids = "" -%}{%- assign t_n = 0 -%}{%- assign m_n = 0 -%}{%- assign stale_lgs = "" -%}
{%- for g in games -%}
  {%- if g.local_date == today or g.local_date == yesterday and g.state == "live" -%}
    {%- assign t_ids = t_ids | append: forloop.index0 | append: "," -%}{%- assign t_n = t_n | plus: 1 -%}
  {%- elsif g.local_date == tomorrow -%}
    {%- assign m_ids = m_ids | append: forloop.index0 | append: "," -%}{%- assign m_n = m_n | plus: 1 -%}
  {%- else -%}{%- continue -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if g.stale -%}{%- assign stale_lgs = stale_lgs | append: g.league | append: "," -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- assign total = t_n | plus: m_n -%}
{%- comment -%} An empty screen leaves the playlist, unless the error banner has been up 24 hours: then a broken collector shows. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign err_up = 0 -%}
{%- for e in errors -%}{%- assign up = e.since | date: "%s" | plus: 0 -%}{%- assign up = now_s | minus: up -%}{%- if up > err_up -%}{%- assign err_up = up -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}
{%- if total == 0 and err_up < 86400 -%}<script>window.TRMNL_SKIP_DISPLAY = true</script>{%- endif -%}
{%- comment -%} Rows grow to fill the height: k = 1.25 - 0.1 x (games - 5), never above 1.25. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign k = total | minus: 5 | times: 0.1 -%}{%- assign k = 1.25 | minus: k -%}{%- if k > 1.25 -%}{%- assign k = 1.25 -%}{%- endif -%}
<style>
  .gt { --u: 1; --z: calc(var(--k) * var(--u)); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: calc(var(--z) * 16px); width: 100%; height: 100%; padding: 4px 6px 0; }
  .gt, .gt * { font-family: var(--title-font-family); }
  .gt-sec { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-height: 0; flex: var(--n) 1 0; }
  .gt-head { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px; border-bottom: calc(var(--u) * 3px) solid #000; padding-bottom: 4px; }
  .gt-head b { font-size: calc(var(--z) * 22px); letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .gt-head span { font-size: calc(var(--z) * 17px); color: #555; font-weight: 700; }
  .gt-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex: 1; }

  /* A game row: league | followed team, vs or @, opponent | time or score | channels */
  .gt-row { flex: 1; display: grid; grid-template-columns: calc(var(--z) * 40px) calc(var(--z) * 390px) minmax(0, 1fr) calc(var(--z) * 260px); align-items: center; gap: calc(var(--z) * 12px); padding: calc(var(--z) * 10px) 0; }
  .gt-row + .gt-row { border-top: 1.5px solid #bbb; }
  .gt-lg { font-size: calc(var(--z) * 13px); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .08em; color: #555; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .gt-match { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: calc(var(--z) * 12px); min-width: 0; }
  .gt-abbr { font-size: calc(var(--z) * 30px); font-weight: 700; min-width: 2.6em; }
  .gt-logo { width: calc(var(--z) * 50px); height: calc(var(--z) * 50px); object-fit: contain; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .gt-ch { height: calc(var(--z) * 36px); max-width: calc(var(--z) * 110px); object-fit: contain; }
  .gt-sep { font-size: calc(var(--z) * 20px); font-weight: 700; color: #666; padding: 0 4px; }
  .gt-stat { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; line-height: 1.1; }
  .gt-time, .gt-score { font-size: calc(var(--z) * 30px); font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gt-sub { font-size: calc(var(--z) * 16px); font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 3px; }
  .gt-live { background: #000; color: #fff; border-radius: 4px; padding: 0 6px; font-size: .8em; letter-spacing: .08em; }
  .gt-pp { font-size: calc(var(--z) * 22px); font-weight: 700; color: #555; font-style: italic; }
  .gt-chs { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: flex-end; align-items: center; gap: 8px calc(var(--z) * 14px); }
  .gt-chtxt { white-space: nowrap; font-size: calc(var(--z) * 16px); font-weight: 700; border: 2px solid #000; border-radius: 6px; padding: 2px 8px; }
  .gt-dim { opacity: .55; }
  /* Error banner: one black pill per failing source, as on the Media screen */
  .gt-errs { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .gt-err { display: inline-flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; background: #000; color: #fff; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 9px; padding: 4px 16px 5px 12px; }
  .gt-err .why { font-family: var(--description-font-family); font-weight: 400; }
  .gt-stale { font-size: calc(var(--z) * 13px); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; border: 1.5px solid #000; border-radius: 5px; padding: 0 6px 1px; margin-top: 4px; }
  /* A live game is framed, with a larger score, so it stands out */
  .gt-row.live { border: calc(var(--u) * 3px) solid #000 !important; border-radius: calc(var(--u) * 10px); padding-inline: calc(var(--z) * 10px); }
  .gt-row.live + .gt-row { border-top: 0; }
  .gt-row.live .gt-score { font-size: calc(var(--z) * 36px); }
  .gt-row.live .gt-sub { font-size: calc(var(--z) * 20px); }
  /* Images made for the OG (gt-og) replace the X's 8-gray ones (gt-xo) there */
  .gt-og { display: none; }

  /* The OG (1- and 2-bit, per ADR-0005): smaller, no gray, nothing under 10px */
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .gt { --u: .58; padding: 0; }
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) :is(.gt-lg, .gt-head span, .gt-sep, .gt-pp) { color: #000; }
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) :is(.gt-lg, .gt-chtxt) { font-size: max(10px, calc(var(--z) * 14px)); }
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .gt-sub { font-size: max(11px, calc(var(--z) * 16px)); }
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .gt-sub .gt-live { font-size: 10px; }
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .gt-errs { gap: 6px; }
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .gt-err { font-size: 14px; gap: 6px; border-radius: 6px; padding: 2px 10px 3px 8px; }
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .gt-stale { font-size: 10px; border-width: 1px; border-radius: 3px; margin-top: 1px; padding: 0 4px; }
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .gt-row + .gt-row { border-top: 1px solid #000; }
  /* The OG is too narrow for wrapped channels: they keep one line and take the width that's left */
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .gt-row { grid-template-columns: calc(var(--z) * 40px) calc(var(--z) * 390px) calc(var(--z) * 200px) minmax(0, 1fr); min-height: 0; overflow: hidden; }
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .gt-chs { flex-wrap: nowrap; overflow: hidden; gap: 6px; }
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .gt-list { min-height: 0; overflow: hidden; }
  /* 1-bit has no gray: finals drop to regular weight instead of dimming */
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .gt-dim { opacity: 1; }
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .gt-dim :is(.gt-abbr, .gt-score, .gt-sub) { font-weight: 400; }
  /* 1-bit logos and icons are made at their exact pixel size (32 and 20 px), so they are never scaled */
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .gt-xo { display: none; }
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) .gt-og { display: inline-block; }
  :is(.screen--1bit, .screen--2bit) img.gt-og { width: auto; height: auto; max-width: none; flex-shrink: 0; image-rendering: pixelated; }
</style>

<div class="view view--full">
<div class="layout"><div class="gt" style="--k: {{ k }}">
  {%- assign err_n = errors | size -%}
  {%- if err_n > 0 -%}
  <div class="gt-errs">
    {%- for e in errors -%}
    {%- assign since_s = e.since | date: "%s" | plus: off -%}
    {%- assign up = e.since | date: "%s" | plus: 0 -%}{%- assign up = now_s | minus: up -%}
    {%- if up < 86400 -%}{%- assign since = since_s | date: "%-I:%M %p" -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign since = since_s | date: "%a %-I:%M %p" -%}{%- endif -%}
    <span class="gt-err"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1.1em" height="1.1em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;vertical-align:-0.18em"><path d="M12 3L2 20.5h20z"/><path d="M12 10v4.5M12 17.5v.5"/></svg>
      {%- if e.source contains "unknown-team:" -%}<span>Unknown team: {{ e.source | remove_first: "unknown-team:" }}</span>
      {%- else -%}{%- assign lg = e.source | remove_first: "espn-" -%}
        <span>{% if e.source contains "espn-" %}ESPN {{ lg | upcase }}{% else %}{{ e.source }}{% endif %} down since {{ since }}</span>
        {%- if stale_lgs contains lg -%}<span class="why">· showing its last data</span>{%- endif -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    </span>
    {%- endfor -%}
  </div>
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- for sec in (1..2) -%}
    {%- if sec == 1 -%}{%- assign ids = t_ids | split: "," -%}{%- assign n = t_n -%}{%- assign label = "Today" -%}{%- assign day_s = local_s -%}
    {%- else -%}{%- assign ids = m_ids | split: "," -%}{%- assign n = m_n -%}{%- assign label = "Tomorrow" -%}{%- assign day_s = local_s | plus: 86400 -%}{%- endif -%}
    {%- if n == 0 -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
    <section class="gt-sec" style="--n: {{ n }}">
      <div class="gt-head"><b>{{ label }}</b><span>{{ day_s | date: "%a, %b %-d" }}</span></div>
      <div class="gt-list">
      {%- for id in ids -%}{%- if id == "" -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
        {%- assign i = id | plus: 0 -%}{%- assign g = games[i] -%}
        {%- if g.followed.home -%}{%- assign sep = "vs" -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign sep = "@" -%}{%- endif -%}
        <div class="gt-row{% if g.state == 'final' %} gt-dim{% elsif g.state == 'live' %} live{% endif %}">
          <span class="gt-lg">{{ g.league }}</span>
          {%- comment -%} The row reads first, "vs" or "@", second. Two followed teams meeting read away "@" home; followed is the home team then. {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- if g.both_followed -%}{%- assign a = g.opponent -%}{%- assign b = g.followed -%}{%- assign sep = "@" -%}
          {%- else -%}{%- assign a = g.followed -%}{%- assign b = g.opponent -%}{%- endif -%}
          <div class="gt-match">
            {%- for side in (1..2) -%}
              {%- if side == 1 -%}{%- assign t = a -%}{%- else -%}<span class="gt-sep">{{ sep }}</span>{%- assign t = b -%}{%- endif -%}
              {%- comment -%} The OG takes the 1-bit logo, else dithers the gray one; a team with no logo is its abbreviation alone. {%- endcomment -%}
              {%- if t.logo -%}{%- assign one = logos1[t.logo] -%}
                <img class="gt-logo{% if one %} gt-xo{% endif %}" src="{{ logos[t.logo] }}" alt="">
                {%- if one -%}<img class="gt-og" src="{{ one }}" alt="">{%- endif -%}
              {%- endif -%}
              <span class="gt-abbr">{{ t.abbr }}</span>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
          <div class="gt-stat">
            {%- case g.state -%}
            {%- when "scheduled" -%}<span class="gt-time">{{ g.start | date: "%s" | plus: off | date: "%-I:%M %p" }}</span>
            {%- when "postponed" -%}<span class="gt-pp">Postponed</span>
            {%- when "live" -%}<span class="gt-score">{{ a.score }}–{{ b.score }}</span>
              {%- comment -%} A stale game's status is from an older push, so it reads plain "LIVE" too. {%- endcomment -%}
              <span class="gt-sub"><span class="gt-live">LIVE</span>{% if age < 1200 and g.stale != true %}{{ g.status }}{% endif %}</span>
            {%- else -%}<span class="gt-score">{{ a.score }}–{{ b.score }}</span><span class="gt-sub">Final</span>
            {%- endcase -%}
            {%- if g.stale -%}<span class="gt-stale">stale</span>{%- endif -%}
          </div>
          <div class="gt-chs">
            {%- comment -%} The OG shows a channel's 1-bit icon, else its name. {%- endcomment -%}
            {%- for c in g.channels -%}
              {%- if c.icon -%}{%- assign one = icons1[c.name] -%}
                <img class="gt-ch gt-xo" src="{{ icons[c.name] }}" alt="{{ c.name }}">
                {%- if one -%}<img class="gt-og" src="{{ one }}" alt="{{ c.name }}">{%- else -%}<span class="gt-chtxt gt-og">{{ c.name }}</span>{%- endif -%}
              {%- else -%}<span class="gt-chtxt">{{ c.name }}</span>{%- endif -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
        </div>
      {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    </section>
  {%- endfor -%}
</div></div>
<div class="title_bar">
  <span class="title" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1.15em" height="1.15em" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="vertical-align:-0.2em"><path d="M8 3v3M16 3v3"/><rect x="2.5" y="6" width="19" height="14" rx="2.5"/><path d="M12 9.5v7"/><path d="M7 10v6"/><rect x="15" y="10" width="3" height="6" rx="1.2"/></svg> Game Time</span>
  <span class="instance">updated {{ upd_s | plus: off | date: "%-I:%M %p" }}</span>
</div>
</div>
